<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces are now conducting airstrikes and ground assaults against Haitian gang leaders while Haitian police raids in Port-au-Prince have eliminated suspected gang members. A market near the capital was attacked, leaving ten dead and seven injured, and a separate attack killed 47 civilians, prompting a UN condemnation and EU sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. Bukele has disclosed the deaths of El Salvador troops operating in Haiti. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQU3RheHgwdFB4cXN6cDk0SEdPZzdwOUtwV212a29zdWdycDd4YkxETUI1ZTNpdFRkeElsRGNmRGZvcHh2N285LTRMSVFkbmVJRmtsaVpkR2ZLT3NzU0xObW9qYmlHYmwyOTYyLU42MUlpSkJkT1Bwb3dUSlR3OGY5U1BKQ2FrSmFmcHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOd1ZybFN5Zlh1RUlFM1V0dmIzd2RuUEdDRTlQdlRWbUlXSGY2VVhaajJQOFJiQUFTMVRyWjIyTkVGQTVaYmR6d1V4d0xlWWFycThGUEVoYnRRWGJRdXdiVlNKWGt0M0txSDZzUm1xYmJpYm93cnVEU1hyNmZQSml5bGFod0RsZjdFTWpxS2RELWFnbHFxNkZOZUFkYThJekpVamtzVlNKSUliQk1nNmhNa2V4ZS00QnZPdjQzWnBTS2gzWTBU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jamaica Gleaner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQTFhiLU5QQWJrcTVfSjdBVEZQUWpNWVQ5S0F5SFJCeFFhc05pdEl1dExoWjlZem5pTmhvQ1YyRWlQeGdsSE9mU0J2dFpFNTlPdnZQT3RJdlNUdFk2VWhQUnQ5X2s0bl8xTkpkeFRaWnJtQkFjY0R3MWc3amdQVkI1Wi1zYVRNSW1KSFJsNllyczNtRUc2bFg5RjRHU1I3c1BXcXV1VDZrS0RjQmZPNGZCYVUzcGdYdFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Goshen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPYmlLbVRWYTQ2aXBodjN0Yi1xd0xFSzJyYnZMcjVhWWNxaGFkMXVRYWhmcW1vT3VEdGtORnQ1aDZVNzRQV3JLRmZIVTgwUlRVOUhENzkyRHlyMGRBVUQ2U0tKdmJaNnV5SVc2ejNnMC1IT2l2UzQxajdyWG1PNlVJRlp6ZzBRV1U4QjRGcm5MaVdwUlBXSXphUkhLeTNnUUlFQVE?oc=5&qu